    "id": "evt_columbia_78cd5393",
    "name": "Get to Know Your Computer",
    "description": "&lt;p&gt;Knowing how to use your computer is one thing, but knowing how to get the most out of it is another. Why might you need more RAM or a GPU? What is the BIOS? And how does &amp;ldquo;the cloud&amp;rdquo; fit in? Whether you have a brand new computer or you want to make the most of the one you already have, this workshop will help you answer these questions and more. We&amp;rsquo;ll go into the terminology and the capabilities, limitations, and potential of your computer, whether it&amp;#39;s a PC, Mac, Chromebook, or something else.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Attendees are encouraged, but not required, to bring a laptop.&lt;/p&gt;",
